==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{ety|ru|:inh|sla-pro:*opętь}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*opętь}}. Cognates include {{cog|cs|opět}} and {{cog|sh|opet}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|опя́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-опять.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|ætʲ}}

===Adverb===
{{ru-adv|опя́ть}}

# [[again]] {{gloss|''occurring another time''}}
#: {{syn|ru|сно́ва}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1924|author=w:ru:Михаил Булгаков<t:{{w|Mikhail Bulgakov}}>|title=w:ru:Дьяволиада|chapter=s:ru:[[Дьяволиада (Булгаков)/V|V. Дьявольский фокус]]|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=K. M. Cook-Horujy|title2=w:en:Diaboliad|location2=Moscow|publisher2=Raduga Publishers|year2=1990|page2=|pageurl2=
|text=Лифт останови́лся, вы́плюнул челове́ка с портфе́лем, закры́лся се́ткой и '''опя́ть''' ушё́л вниз.|t=The lift stopped, spat out a man with a briefcase, pulled  the  bars  over  its  face  and  went down '''again'''.}}
# {{lb|ru|usually in the combination {{m-self|ru|[[опя́ть]] [[же]]}}}} [[again]] ({{n-g|used when re-emphasising something already stated}})
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Опя́ть''' [[же]], [[мне́ние]] [[э́то]] [[сугу́бо]] [[личный|ли́чное]].|'''Again''', this is purely personal opinion.}}

